  "dry_snp_activity": "On the Post-Panamax sector, the “Lowlands Rise” - 96K/2013 Imabari was sold for USD 26 mills. Greek buyers acquired the Kamsarmax “YMK Quartet”- 82K/2021 YAMIC for USD 35.5 mills. The Ultramax “Aries Sumire” - 64K/2020 Shin Kurushima was sold for USD 36 mills to clients of Meghna, while the Scrub- ber fitted and Electronic M/E “African Lion” - 67K/2013 Mitsui was sold for USD 24.5 mills to Greek buyers. On the Supramax sector, the scrubber fitted “Crowned Eagle” - 56K/2008 IHI changed hands for mid USD 16 mills. Last but not least, the Handysize “Perseus Harmony”- 37K/2020 Saiki found new own- ers for USD 29.5 mills.\n\nNAME DWT YEAR COUNTRY YARD BUYERS PRICE ($ mills) COMMENTS",
